            "review_text": "Annie T\nSan Bernardino, California39 contributions\n0\nAmazing Food & Outstanding Service – Highly Recommended!\nMar 2025 • Couples\nAmazing Food & Outstanding Service – Highly Recommended!\n\nMy husband and I came here after our friend Danh recommended Ma Kitchen, and we’re so glad we did!\n\nWe tried the truffle rice with abalone, various drinks, and several other dishes, and everything was delicious. The food was so good that we came back the next day to try even more, and once again, it did not disappoint!\n\nThe service was exceptional—staff were friendly, helpful, and welcoming. The restaurant is very clean, beautifully decorated, and creates a warm, inviting atmosphere.\n\nWe will definitely return before we head home and highly recommend this restaurant to everyone. You can truly feel the passion and heart they put into their food and service, ensuring every customer has a fantastic dining experience.\n\nIf they ever plan to expand to the U.S., I’d love to be a part of helping them grow—this level of quality and care deserves to be shared!\nRead more\nWritten March 31, 2025",
