            "review_title": "Review at A Mà Kitchen",
            "review_text": "trucgoesplaces\nSingapore, Singapore304 contributions\n0\nGREAT FAMILY DINNER EXPERIENCE\nFeb 2024 • Family\nPurposely came here for their dimsum. A fine selection of dimsum, must say: delicate, bursting and good size. The charsiew was flavourful and the fried rice was delicious.\n\nService was friendly, efficient and subtle too. To be more precise, the service was second to none and the food was served with poise and speed.\n\nThe evening was a delight. No faults at all. From start to finish, it was a great meal and evening. Definitely worth the price and for celebratory occasions.\n\nBook well in advance as they fill up quick.\nRead more\nWritten January 26, 2025",
