            "review_title": "Review at A Mà Kitchen",
            "review_text": "Lien Ung U\n1 contribution\n0\nTam Thuong - the A Ma kitchen is not as good as expected-Poor\nJan 2024 • Friends\nThe A Ma kitchen is not as good as expected. I have been som dimsum restaurants with Hongkong stype in Saigon and in som where in asian. Dimsum in A Ma kitchen in Cong Quynh Street can often taste worse than the other places in Saigon like Bao Dimsum seller Ai Hue restaurant. Besides that, the service was not professonal because we had to wait for long time over 15 min for every dish. We will never come back to this place again.\n\nI think A Ma's kitchen is not as good as expected. I have been to several Hong Kong style dim sum restaurants in Saigon and some places in Asia. Dimsum at A Ma kitchen on Cong Quynh street often tastes worse than other places in Saigon like Bao Dimsum or Ai Hue restaurant. Besides, the service was not professional because we had to wait a long time, more than 15 minutes for each dish. We will never return to this place again.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten February 27, 2024",
